1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:02,530
(Howard:)So, Dr. Hofstadter...

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:06,870
(Howard:)...Leonard rarely talks about his
incredibly successful brother and sister.

3
00:00:07,038 --> 00:00:10,078
- Please don't go there, Howard.
- You know, I understand...

4
00:00:10,249 --> 00:00:15,459
(Howard:)...that unlike Leonard,
they're at the top of their respective fields.

5
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,170
(Leonard:)Boy, you suck.

6
00:00:18,716 --> 00:00:22,386
(Beverley:)Leonard's younger brother, Michael,
is a tenured law professor at Harvard...

7
00:00:22,553 --> 00:00:27,263
(Beverley:)...and his sister just successfully grew
a human pancreas in an adolescent gibbon.

8
00:00:28,476 --> 00:00:31,146
(Howard:)So she's close to curing diabetes?

9
00:00:31,312 --> 00:00:34,442
(Beverley:)Why else would you grow
a pancreas in a teenaged gibbon?

10
00:00:35,691 --> 00:00:37,401
(Howard:)Wow, you must be very proud.

11
00:00:37,568 --> 00:00:39,908
(Beverley:)Why? They're not my accomplishments.

12
00:00:41,113 --> 00:00:43,113
(Beverley:)I have to urinate.

13
00:00:46,786 --> 00:00:49,076
- Why are you doing this?
- You know the rules.

14
00:00:49,247 --> 00:00:52,337
(Howard:)You brought your mom to work.
You must suffer.

15
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:53,790
[HOWARD CHUCKLES]

16
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:57,630
(Sheldon:)Leonard, I had no idea your siblings
were so much more successful than you.

17
00:00:57,797 --> 00:00:59,127
[RAJESH CHUCKLES]

18
00:00:59,298 --> 00:01:04,028
(Raj:)Yeah, you're like the Jar Jar Binks
of the Hofstadter family.

